	"data": "Node: alienware (Dell Alienware M17) — DECOMMISSIONED\n\nStatus\nDecommissioned 2026-04-13. 14-year-old laptop, not viable for any homelab role. Parts harvested for Optiplex migration.\n\nWhy Decommissioned\ni7-3740QM (Ivy Bridge, 2012) — outperformed by Optiplex's i5-6500 at half the power draw\nGTX 680M (Kepler) — no NVENC support for modern Plex, can't run current CUDA workloads\n16 GB DDR3 — limits container density; Optiplex has 32 GB DDR4\nLaptop form factor — not designed for 24/7 operation…",
